'This Clob Loader includes a sanitizer for HTML as option to use:',
'A Full Description you will find on: https://github.com/cure53/DOMPurify',
'Example: ',
'<pre>',
'{',
'  "ALLOWED_ATTR": [',
'    "accesskey",',
'    "align",',
'    "alt",',
